s.go.com/amp/Entertainment/london-rocks-nelson-mandela/story?id=5268443"}, {"title": "amy winehouse sings for mandela amid health concerns 64191", "url": "https://www.accessonline.com/articles/amy-winehouse-sings-for-mandela-amid-health-concerns-64191"}, {"title": "Singer Amy Winehouse Takes the Stage at Nelson Mandela's Birthday Show", "url": "https://www.foxnews.com/story/singer-amy-winehouse-takes-the-stage-at-nelson-mandelas-birthday-show.amp"}, {"title": "Print Print    Close Close", "url": "https://www.foxnews.com/story/singer-amy-winehouse-takes-the-stage-at-nelson-mandelas-birthday-show.print"}, {"title": "www.imdb.de", "url": "https://www.imdb.de/name/nm1561881/bio"}, {"title": "Iconic Spotlight : Amy Winehouse, by Terry O’Neill", "url": "https://iconicimages.net/news/iconic-spotlight-amy-winehouse-by-terry-oneill"}]}, "The search confirms the concert and Winehouse's performance, but not the Song of the Year award.\n\n- **Concert:** Winehouse performed at the Nelson Mandela 90th birthday concert in London's Hyde Park on June 27, 2008, one of more than 30 acts. She was among the more than 30 world's leading performers who paid tribute to Nelson Mandela at a birthday concert in London's Hyde Park on Friday night.\n- **Her set:** She sang \"Rehab\" and \"Valerie.\" Her hospital stay that month had been for early-stage emphysema, and she left hospital for one evening to perform for Nelson Mandela on his 90th birthday celebration in London's Hyde Park.\n- **Grammys:** A biography source says Amy Winehouse became the first British female to win 5 Grammy Awards on the same night, February 10th, 2008, including Best New Artist and Record of the Year for 'Rehab'. The results do not mention Song of the Year. That award for \"Rehab\" is my own recollection and needs checking against an official Grammy source."], "durationSeconds": 9.682518083, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01WLnn6zfiMSVcpaFZs7QTbi", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
