{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXnMnncmwLs2DwYyqKJ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：4 个元音**（按出生时取的名字 Rolihlahla 算）。\n\n- 2008 年（第 50 届）格莱美年度歌曲奖颁给了 Amy Winehouse 的《Rehab》。同年 6 月 27 日，她在伦敦海德公园的曼德拉 90 岁生日音乐会上演唱了《Rehab》和《Valerie》。\n- 所以生日会的主人是 Nelson Mandela。他出生时的名字是 **Rolihlahla**，元音是 o、i、a、a，共 4 个。\n- 题目说的 \"given first name\" 有两种理解。如果指常用名 **Nelson**（上学时老师给他取的），元音是 e、o，共 2 个。\n\n有两点没有用搜索核实：《Rehab》拿的是年度歌曲奖，这是我自己记得的，搜到的资料只写了年度制作和最佳新人；名字 Rolihlahla 也是我自己记得的。这次只搜了 1 次。\n\n来源：\n- [ABC News: London Rocks for Nelson Mandela](https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/london-rocks-nelson-mandela/story?id=5268443)\n- [Fox News: Amy Winehouse Takes the Stage at Nelson Mandela's Birthday Show](https://www.foxnews.com/story/singer-amy-winehouse-takes-the-stage-at-nelson-mandelas-birthday-show.amp)\n- [Access Online: Amy Winehouse sings for Mandela](https://www.accessonline.com/articles/amy-winehouse-sings-for-mandela-amid-health-concerns-64191)\n- [IMDb: Amy Winehouse bio](https://www.imdb.de/name/nm1561881/bio)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1407, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4338, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1407}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:52.772Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXnMUBhs3YjhWFfxMzA"}
